
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AFAYAI Nexus</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#08111f;
      --bg-soft:#0d1a2e;
      --panel:#11233d;
      --panel-2:#152b4a;
      --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      --text:#e9f1ff;
      --muted:#afc2e6;
      --blue:#4ea1ff;
      --blue-2:#2d7de0;
      --green:#33c27f;
      --gold:#f4b942;
      --danger:#ff7a7a;
      --shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
      --radius:18px;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#07101d 0%,#0b1830 100%);color:var(--text)}
    a{color:inherit}
    button,select{font:inherit}

    .topbar{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      background:rgba(6,12,24,.82);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .topbar-inner{
      max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 18px;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
    }

    .brand-mark{
      width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--green));
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      font-weight:700;color:white;
    }

    .brand-copy h1{
      margin:0;font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:.3px;
    }

    .brand-copy p{
      margin:3px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;
    }

    .toolbar{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .language-wrap,
    .pill{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:8px 12px;
      color:var(--text);
    }

    select{
      background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--text);outline:none;
    }

    select option{
      color:#111;
    }

    .layout{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;
      min-height:calc(100vh - 78px);
    }

    .sidebar{
      border-right:1px solid var(--line);
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03),rgba(255,255,255,.01));
      padding:20px 14px;
    }

    .nav-group-title{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.82rem;
      letter-spacing:.8px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      margin:14px 10px 10px;
    }

    .nav-btn{
      width:100%;
      text-align:left;
      border:none;
      border-radius:14px;
      padding:14px 14px;
      margin-bottom:8px;
      cursor:pointer;
      color:var(--text);
      background:transparent;
      border:1px solid transparent;
      transition:.2s ease;
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      border-color:var(--line);
    }

    .nav-btn.active{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(78,161,255,.18),rgba(51,194,127,.12));
      border-color:rgba(78,161,255,.32);
      box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(78,161,255,.12);
    }

    .nav-icon{
      width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
      font-size:.95rem;
      flex-shrink:0;
    }

    .content{
      padding:22px;
    }

    .section{display:none}
    .section.active{display:block}

    .hero{
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(78,161,255,.16), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at left bottom, rgba(51,194,127,.12), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.04), rgba(255,255,255,.02));
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:26px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:26px;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }

    .hero-row{
      display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .hero h2{
      margin:0 0 10px;font-size:2rem;
    }

    .hero p{
      margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:950px;font-size:1rem;
    }

    .hero-badges{
      display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;
    }

    .badge{
      padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.85rem;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      color:var(--text);
    }

    .badge.blue{background:rgba(78,161,255,.14);border-color:rgba(78,161,255,.3)}
    .badge.green{background:rgba(51,194,127,.14);border-color:rgba(51,194,127,.28)}
    .badge.gold{background:rgba(244,185,66,.14);border-color:rgba(244,185,66,.28)}

    .grid{
      display:grid;
      gap:16px;
    }

    .grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
    .grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
    .grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}

    .card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.045), rgba(255,255,255,.025));
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:18px;
      min-width:0;
    }

    .card h3{
      margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.02rem;
    }

    .card p{
      margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.96rem;
    }

    .card ul{
      margin:10px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted);
      padding:0;
    }

    .stat-number{
      font-size:2rem;
      font-weight:700;
      margin-bottom:6px;
      color:var(--blue);
    }

    .section-title{
      margin:28px 0 12px;
      font-size:1.15rem;
      color:#f4f8ff;
    }

    .progress-block{margin-top:14px}
    .progress-row{
      display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
      margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;
    }

    .progress{
      height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden
    }

    .progress > span{
      display:block;height:100%;border-radius:999px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--green));
    }

    .kpi{
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
    }

    .kpi small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}

    .label{
      display:inline-block;
      padding:6px 10px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      color:var(--text);
      font-size:.82rem;
      margin:8px 8px 0 0;
    }

    .cta-row{
      display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;
    }

    .btn{
      border:none;cursor:pointer;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;font-weight:700;
      transition:.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--blue-2));
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(45,125,224,.35);
    }

    .btn-secondary{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      color:var(--text);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}

    .table-wrap{
      overflow:auto;
      border-radius:16px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);
    }

    table{
      width:100%;
      border-collapse:collapse;
      min-width:700px;
    }

    th,td{
      padding:14px 12px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      text-align:left;
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    th{color:#d9e6ff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
    td{color:var(--muted)}

    .footer{
      margin-top:24px;
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.9rem;
      padding:20px 0 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px){
      .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .sidebar{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
      .grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
      .grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px){
      .content{padding:16px}
      .hero{padding:18px}
      .hero h2{font-size:1.55rem}
      .grid-4,.grid-3,.grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .topbar-inner{padding:12px 14px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">AN</div>
        <div class="brand-copy">
          <h1 id="brandName">AFAYAI Nexus</h1>
          <p id="brandTagline">Connecting people to skills, health, agriculture, and opportunity.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="toolbar">
        <div class="pill" id="platformMode">Unified Platform Demo</div>
        <div class="language-wrap">
          <label for="languageSelect" style="margin-right:8px;" id="languageLabel">Language</label>
          <select id="languageSelect" onchange="changeLanguage(this.value)">
            <option value="en">English</option>
            <option value="fr">French</option>
            <option value="ar">Arabic</option>
            <option value="sw">Swahili</option>
            <option value="ha">Hausa (Nigeria)</option>
            <option value="yo">Yoruba (Nigeria)</option>
            <option value="ig">Igbo (Nigeria)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="nav-group-title" id="navGroupMain">Main Navigation</div>

      <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="showSection('dashboard', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">⌂</span>
        <span id="navDashboard">Dashboard</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showSection('learning', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">🎓</span>
        <span id="navLearning">Learning & Development</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showSection('workforce', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">👥</span>
        <span id="navWorkforce">Workforce</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showSection('health', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">✚</span>
        <span id="navHealth">AFAYAI Health</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showSection('agritech', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">🌱</span>
        <span id="navAgritech">Agritech</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showSection('agritrade', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">🚚</span>
        <span id="navAgritrade">Agritrade</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="showSection('profile', this)">
        <span class="nav-icon">☻</span>
        <span id="navProfile">Profile</span>
      </button>
    </aside>

    <main class="content">
      <section id="dashboard" class="section active">
        <div class="hero">
          <div class="hero-row">
            <div>
              <h2 id="dashboardTitle">AFAYAI Nexus Overview</h2>
              <p id="dashboardIntro">
                AFAYAI Nexus is a unified platform combining AFAYAI telehealth, agritech services,
                Agritrade market access, workforce development, and a scaled learning system into one experience.
              </p>

              <div class="hero-badges">
                <span class="badge blue" id="badgeHealth">Telehealth</span>
                <span class="badge green" id="badgeLearning">Learning</span>
                <span class="badge gold" id="badgeTrade">Agritrade</span>
                <span class="badge blue" id="badgeWorkforce">Workforce</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-4">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="stat-number">4</div>
            <h3 id="dashStat1Title">Core Service Engines</h3>
            <p id="dashStat1Text">Health, agriculture, trade, and learning connected in one platform.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="stat-number">1</div>
            <h3 id="dashStat2Title">Unified User Journey</h3>
            <p id="dashStat2Text">One profile connects skills, services, opportunities, and progress.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="stat-number">Lite</div>
            <h3 id="dashStat3Title">Embedded Learning</h3>
            <p id="dashStat3Text">A scaled-down learning engine inspired by Koachlearn.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="stat-number">Demo</div>
            <h3 id="dashStat4Title">Testing Prototype</h3>
            <p id="dashStat4Text">Built for GitHub Pages testing, partner walkthroughs, and early validation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="section-title" id="dashValueTitle">Platform Value</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="dashCard1Title">Learn to Earn</h3>
            <p id="dashCard1Text">Users complete practical training and move into roles, assignments, and income pathways.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="dashCard2Title">Health + Productivity</h3>
            <p id="dashCard2Text">Telehealth access supports healthier communities and stronger workforce participation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="dashCard3Title">Farmer-Centered Growth</h3>
            <p id="dashCard3Text">Agritech and Agritrade tools improve readiness, visibility, and access to markets.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="learning" class="section">
        <div class="hero">
          <h2 id="learningTitle">Learning & Development</h2>
          <p id="learningIntro">
            This learning module is the built-in training engine of AFAYAI Nexus. It supports practical,
            multilingual, workforce-aligned learning for farmers, youth, women, health workers, and community members.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-badges">
            <span class="badge green" id="learnBadge1">Skill Tracks</span>
            <span class="badge blue" id="learnBadge2">Micro-Certificates</span>
            <span class="badge gold" id="learnBadge3">Workforce Readiness</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="learningPath1Title">Digital Foundations</h3>
            <p id="learningPath1Text">Smartphone use, internet basics, messaging, online safety, and digital communication.</p>
            <div class="progress-block">
              <div class="progress-row"><span id="progressLabel1">Progress</span><span>82%</span></div>
              <div class="progress"><span style="width:82%"></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="label" id="tagBeginner">Beginner</span>
            <span class="label" id="tagYouth">Youth</span>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="learningPath2Title">Agritech Skills</h3>
            <p id="learningPath2Text">Crop planning, climate awareness, post-harvest handling, digital farm records, and input planning.</p>
            <div class="progress-block">
              <div class="progress-row"><span id="progressLabel2">Progress</span><span>56%</span></div>
              <div class="progress"><span style="width:56%"></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="label" id="tagFarmers">Farmers</span>
            <span class="label" id="tagProduction">Production</span>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="learningPath3Title">Telehealth Support</h3>
            <p id="learningPath3Text">Patient navigation, care access support, digital intake basics, and community health education.</p>
            <div class="progress-block">
              <div class="progress-row"><span id="progressLabel3">Progress</span><span>41%</span></div>
              <div class="progress"><span style="width:41%"></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="label" id="tagHealth">Health</span>
            <span class="label" id="tagCommunity">Community</span>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="learningPath4Title">Work Readiness</h3>
            <p id="learningPath4Text">Professional communication, reliability, problem solving, attendance, and basic task management.</p>
            <div class="progress-block">
              <div class="progress-row"><span id="progressLabel4">Progress</span><span>91%</span></div>
              <div class="progress"><span style="width:91%"></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="label" id="tagJobs">Jobs</span>
            <span class="label" id="tagReadiness">Readiness</span>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="learningPath5Title">Entrepreneurship</h3>
            <p id="learningPath5Text">Pricing, customer service, mobile money, market thinking, and small business basics.</p>
            <div class="progress-block">
              <div class="progress-row"><span id="progressLabel5">Progress</span><span>63%</span></div>
              <div class="progress"><span style="width:63%"></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="label" id="tagBusiness">Business</span>
            <span class="label" id="tagGrowth">Growth</span>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="learningPath6Title">Learning Outcomes</h3>
            <ul id="learningOutcomes">
              <li>Practical training for multilingual users</li>
              <li>Short learning paths tied to job roles</li>
              <li>Farmer-friendly and mobile-friendly delivery</li>
              <li>Certificate-based progression into workforce pathways</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="workforce" class="section">
        <div class="hero">
          <h2 id="workforceTitle">Workforce Development</h2>
          <p id="workforceIntro">
            AFAYAI Nexus connects learning directly to livelihoods. Users build verified skill profiles
            and move into agriculture, health support, logistics, trade operations, and community service roles.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-badges">
            <span class="badge blue" id="workBadge1">Role Matching</span>
            <span class="badge green" id="workBadge2">Skill Profiles</span>
            <span class="badge gold" id="workBadge3">Placement Pathways</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="workCard1Title">Workforce Profile</h3>
            <p id="workCard1Text">Users build a readiness profile based on completed training, certifications, and service participation.</p>
            <span class="label" id="labelReady">Placement Eligible</span>
            <span class="label" id="labelScore">Readiness 82%</span>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="workCard2Title">Placement Channels</h3>
            <ul id="placementChannels">
              <li>Community agriculture support</li>
              <li>Telehealth access assistant</li>
              <li>Learning facilitator</li>
              <li>Farmer network coordinator</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="workCard3Title">Career Ladder</h3>
            <p id="workCard3Text">Beginner learners can move into advanced roles through continued training, field performance, and supervisor validation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="section-title" id="workRoleTableTitle">Sample Workforce Roles</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th id="thRole">Role</th>
                <th id="thTrack">Training Track</th>
                <th id="thStatus">Status</th>
                <th id="thRegion">Region</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td id="role1">Community Agriculture Support Worker</td>
                <td id="track1">Agritech Fundamentals + Work Readiness</td>
                <td id="status1">Open</td>
                <td id="region1">Rural / Regional</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td id="role2">Telehealth Access Assistant</td>
                <td id="track2">Telehealth Support + Digital Foundations</td>
                <td id="status2">Open</td>
                <td id="region2">Clinic / Community Hub</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td id="role3">Farmer Network Coordinator</td>
                <td id="track3">Agritrade Basics + Entrepreneurship</td>
                <td id="status3">Pipeline</td>
                <td id="region3">District / Cooperative</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td id="role4">Learning Facilitator</td>
                <td id="track4">Digital Foundations + Facilitation Skills</td>
                <td id="status4">Pilot</td>
                <td id="region4">Training Center / Mobile</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="health" class="section">
        <div class="hero">
          <h2 id="healthTitle">AFAYAI Health</h2>
          <p id="healthIntro">
            AFAYAI Health extends access to care, community health education, digital triage support,
            and telehealth services for rural and underserved populations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="healthCard1Title">Remote Access</h3>
            <p id="healthCard1Text">Users can access telehealth support through mobile-first and community-based service models.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="healthCard2Title">Community Health</h3>
            <p id="healthCard2Text">Preventive education supports families, women, and local communities.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="healthCard3Title">Health + Workforce</h3>
            <p id="healthCard3Text">Health access improves attendance, retention, productivity, and economic participation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="agritech" class="section">
        <div class="hero">
          <h2 id="agritechTitle">Agritech</h2>
          <p id="agritechIntro">
            The Agritech module supports farmers with digital guidance, production planning,
            crop readiness, local data capture, and farmer-friendly workflows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="agriCard1Title">Farmer Support Tools</h3>
            <ul id="agriList1">
              <li>Crop planning support</li>
              <li>Weather awareness</li>
              <li>Input readiness tracking</li>
              <li>Training-linked guidance</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="agriCard2Title">Freemium Model</h3>
            <p id="agriCard2Text">Core services can remain free for farmers while buyers, NGOs, governments, and ecosystem partners fund scale.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="agriCard3Title">Farmer Outcome</h3>
            <p id="agriCard3Text">Improve productivity, build confidence, and prepare farmers for stronger participation in markets and supply systems.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="agritrade" class="section">
        <div class="hero">
          <h2 id="agritradeTitle">Agritrade</h2>
          <p id="agritradeIntro">
            Agritrade expands beyond production. It supports aggregation, pricing visibility,
            trade readiness, logistics, buyer access, and movement from farm activity to market opportunity.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-badges">
            <span class="badge gold" id="tradeBadge1">Market Access</span>
            <span class="badge blue" id="tradeBadge2">Logistics</span>
            <span class="badge green" id="tradeBadge3">Farmer Networks</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 id="tradeCard1Title">Aggregation</h3>
            <p id="tradeCard1Text">Organize produce from individual farmers and cooperatives into visible, tradable supply groups.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
